    },
    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0537,
      "audio_seconds": 6.0836,
      "rtf": 0.0088,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.5861
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0477,
      "audio_seconds": 5.7585,
      "rtf": 0.0083,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.4745
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.063,
      "audio_seconds": 7.1053,
      "rtf": 0.0089,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.6298
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0421,
      "audio_seconds": 5.2245,
      "rtf": 0.0081,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.3969
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0413,
      "audio_seconds": 4.6092,
      "rtf": 0.009,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.4363
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_05",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The system works — assuming, of course, that the cache has been warmed first.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.039,
      "audio_seconds": 4.8646,
      "rtf": 0.008,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.5915
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_06",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Before deploying, verify the image was rebuilt; a stale image looks identical from outside.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0614,
      "audio_seconds": 6.8499,
      "rtf": 0.009,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.4282
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_07",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "She wanted to know why, given everything that had happened, we were still shipping on Friday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/complex_07.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0507,
      "audio_seconds": 5.9095,
      "rtf": 0.0086,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.4646
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_00",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "I read the report yesterday, and I will read the summary tonight.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-fixed/heteronyms_00.wav",
